<title>USA: Offshore Energy Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Offshore Energy Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.28   profit	 $2.10</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,419   profit	10,589</p>
<p> Revs			 2,482		    3,557</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
